WEBVTT

00:07:58.008 --> 00:08:01.258
where the athletes treat 
their partners like punching bags.

00:08:02.171 --> 00:08:05.649
(Applause)

00:08:07.595 --> 00:08:10.542
In other ways, men --
and especially straight white men --

00:08:10.566 --> 00:08:13.653
can say, "No, I will not publish
with your magazine,

00:08:13.677 --> 00:08:16.963
or participate in your project,
or otherwise work with you,

00:08:16.987 --> 00:08:19.384
until you include a fair number of women,

00:08:19.408 --> 00:08:21.955
both as participants and decision makers.

00:08:22.670 --> 00:08:24.797
I won't work with you
until your publication,

00:08:24.821 --> 00:08:28.582
or your organization, is more inclusive
of all kinds of difference."

00:08:29.225 --> 00:08:31.518
Those of us who are underrepresented